  "id": "p0-05-copyright-case-comparison-reference",
  "title": "最高法院版权裁判比较：候选汇报",
  "style": {
    "fontFace": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
    "background": "FFFFFF",
    "textColor": "173248",
    "accentColor": "087D83"
  },
  "assets": [],
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "g-facts",
      "text": "Google 案涉及 Android 对 Java 接口声明代码的重新实现；此页将事实背景与法律评价分开。",
      "source": "https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/20pdf/18-956_new_0e04.pdf ; https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/20pdf/18-956_new_0e04.pdf",
      "locator": "第 5 页 ; 第 26 页"
    },
    {
      "id": "g-question",
      "text": "Google 案提出可版权性与合理使用两个争点；最高法院仅为本案分析假定 API 可版权。",
      "source": "https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/20pdf/18-956_new_0e04.pdf ; https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/20pdf/18-956_new_0e04.pdf",
      "locator": "第 18 页 ; 第 19 页"
    },
    {
      "id": "g-holding",
      "text": "法院在该重新实现情境下认定合理使用，撤销并发回。",
      "source": "https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/20pdf/18-956_new_0e04.pdf ; https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/20pdf/18-956_new_0e04.pdf",
      "locator": "第 39 页 ; 第 40 页"
    },
    {
      "id": "w-facts",
      "text": "Warhol 案涉及 Goldsmith 摄影作品和 Prince Series；本稿聚焦被争议的杂志许可用途。",
      "source": "https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/22pdf/21-869_87ad.pdf ; https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/22pdf/21-869_87ad.pdf",
      "locator": "第 7 页 ; 第 18 页"
    },
    {
      "id": "w-holding",
      "text": "法院就该特定商业许可用途认定合理使用第一因素有利于 Goldsmith，并维持原判。",
      "source": "https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/22pdf/21-869_87ad.pdf ; https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/22pdf/21-869_87ad.pdf ; https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/22pdf/21-869_87ad.pdf",
      "locator": "第 18 页 ; 第 19 页 ; 第 44 页"
    },
    {
      "id": "w-limit",
      "text": "多数意见明确不评价原 Prince Series 的创作、展示或出售。",
      "source": "https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/22pdf/21-869_87ad.pdf",
      "locator": "第 27 页"
    },
    {
      "id": "comparison",
      "text": "两案的比较须分别核对作品性质、具体使用目的和市场关系；这是待审研究推论，不是第三案规则。",
      "source": "https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/20pdf/18-956_new_0e04.pdf ; https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/22pdf/21-869_87ad.pdf ; https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/22pdf/21-869_87ad.pdf",
      "locator": "第 26 页 ; 第 29 页 ; 第 27 页"
    }
  ],
